#AREA Crater~
#AUTHORS Grimace~





#HELPS
-1 CRATER~
As I was wandering the holy grove one day, seeking out a druid to help 
with a nasty dwarven toe fungus that had been maligning me, I stumbled
into a strange void.  When I emerged, I found myself near Thalos, except
it wasn't the sere desecrated ruins that we know as Thalos, but a 
verdant, lush Thalos, full of wonder and spectacle.  Surely this was
the Thalos of the past, but how?  As I explored the perimeter of the
great city, I came across a crossroads.  I turned north, smelling an
acrid odor from that direction, only to find myself at the bank of
a midnight-black stream, cutting across a place where all the trees had
been burned to the ground.  Across the stream and to the north sprouted a
huge crater, roughly 400 horseheads into the sky, the trees blown down
all around it in a radial pattern.  The light was growing dim, and the
stream ran deep, so I was forced to turn back, but I hope that I will one
day have a chance to explore this strange and wonderful place.  I have
heard stories of gemstones and minerals being harvested from just such
craters near the dwarven kingdom.

				-Grimace 1996
                        
                        (Last update: 1/7/98)~
0 $~



#RANGES 26 36 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NOTELEPORT
#MOBILES
#19400
crater kobold~
A crater kobold~
A crater kobold wanders the crater floor with his pick.~
The crater kobold is quite furry and reeks of carrion.  Although
not known as a mining race, the opportunities presented by this
location were obviously too much for the kobolds to pass up.~
ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_INFRARED
0 S
33 BODY_MOUTH|BODY_TORSO|BODY_HAND BODY_MOUTH|BODY_TORSO|BODY_HAND 1d1+948 2d25+2
12000 RACE_ORC
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
wear all
~
>fight_prog 2~
mpecho The crater kobold swings his pick wildly.
~
>rand_prog 2~
mpoload 19418
put deposit basket
~
>rand_prog 2~
mpecho The crater kobold growls and bares his teeth.
~
>rand_prog 100~
if inroom($r)==15636
  mpecho Prince Arcus smiles at his new pet, then a frown crosses 
  mpecho his face as he quickly slits the kobold with his dirk... 
  mpecho Prince Arcus says, "Filthy animals... but damned good
  mpecho eatin'!" as his personal cook arrives to cart off the carcus.
  say I appreciate the gesture.  This should be proper compensation.
  mpoload 19422
  mpquiet on
  drop i19422
  mpquiet off
  mpecho Prince Arcus drops the Sphere of Incubation.
  mpmload 19410
  mppurge self
endif
~
