#19401
crater shaman~
The crater shaman~
The crater shaman stands here with a contented smile on his face.~
While the kobold race in general is organized into various ranks
determined by military necessity, relegating religion to a minor role,
something has happened to this particular band to turn their
superstitions into a way of life.  The kobold shaman is a product
of that transformation, and he wears the garb of someone of great
importance.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SMART
AFF_INFRARED
250 S
36 BODY_MOUTH|BODY_TORSO|BODY_HAND BODY_MOUTH|BODY_TORSO|BODY_HAND 2d150+400 2d20+20
46555 RACE_ORC
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>give_prog I19400~
nod $n
say You honor me with your gift.
say You have shown great courage and shall be duly rewarded.
mpoload 19401
mpjunk 19400
give sash $n
if quest(0,4,$n) == 1
  say I hope you don't expect to receive a promotion 
  say by doing that tired old quest over and 
  say over again, though.... This thing is already
  say mummified.  How about some fresh blood?
  say Try killing some of those tenticles that keep
  say raiding camp in the middle of the night.  The
  say great Fire in the Sky needs sacrifice.
  sigh 
endif
if quest(0,4,$n) == 0
  say I dub thee "Kobold in Training,  Private 1st Class"
  say With some hard work, you could move up the ranks.
  say Go and make me proud.
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 1
endif
~
>give_prog I19420~
if quest(0,4,$n) == 1
 nod $n
 say You honor me with your gift.
 say You have shown great courage and shall be duly rewarded.
 say I dub thee "Kobold in Training,  Corporal $n."
 say Go and make me proud.
 mpmadd $n quest 0 4 1
else
 if quest(0,4,$n) == 2
  nod $n
  say You honor me with your gift.
  say You have shown great courage and shall be duly rewarded.
  say I dub thee "Kobold in Training,  Sergeant $n."
  say Go and make me proud.
  mpmadd $n quest 0 4 1
 else
  if quest(0,4,$n) == 3
   nod $n
   say You honor me with your gift.
   say You have shown great courage and shall be duly rewarded.
   say I dub thee "Kobold Associate,  2nd Lieutenant $n."
   say Go and make me proud.
   mpmadd $n quest 0 4 1
  else
   if quest(0,4,$n) == 4
    nod $n
    say You honor me with your gift.
    say You have shown great courage and shall be duly rewarded.
    say I dub thee "Kobold Associate,  1st Lieutenant $n."
    say Go and make me proud.
    mpmadd $n quest 0 4 1
   else
    if quest(0,4,$n) == 5
     nod $n
     say You honor me with your gift.
     say You have shown great courage and shall be duly rewarded.
     say I dub thee "Kobold Advisor,  Captain $n."
     say Go and make me proud.
     mpmadd $n quest 0 4 1
    else
     if quest(0,4,$n) == 6
      nod $n
      say You honor me with your gift.
      say You have shown great courage and shall be duly rewarded.
      say I dub thee "Kobold Advisor,  Major $n."
      say Go and make me proud.
      mpmadd $n quest 0 4 1
     else
      if quest(0,4,$n) == 7
       nod $n
       say You honor me with your gift.
       say You have shown great courage and shall be duly rewarded.
       say I dub thee "Kobold Officer,  Lt. Colonel $n."
       say Go and make me proud.
       mpmadd $n quest 0 4 1
      else
       if quest(0,4,$n) == 8
        nod $n
        say You honor me with your gift.
        say You have shown great courage and shall be duly rewarded.
        say I dub thee "Kobold Officer,  Colonel $n."
        say Go and make me proud.
        mpmadd $n quest 0 4 1
       else
        if quest(0,4,$n) == 9
         nod $n
         say You honor me with your gift.
         say You have shown great courage and shall be duly rewarded.
         say I dub thee "Kobold Leader,  General $n."
         say You have earned a place among the kobolds of
         say this tribe as a respected leader and advisor.
         say We shall not forget you.
         say There is a FAVOR I'd like to ask of you...
         mpmadd $n quest 0 4 1
        else
         if quest(0,4,$n)==10
          nod $n
          say You honor me with your gift,
          say but you need not prove your worth to anyone.
          say We are ever appreciative of your efforts.
          bow $n
         else
          say Try grabbing that mummified tenticle first...
         endif
        endif
       endif
      endif
     endif
    endif
   endif
  endif
 endif
endif
mpjunk i19420
~
