>speech_prog p favor~
if quest(0,4,$n)==10
 say While our problems with the tenticles are ongoing and
 say serious, there is native resident in this crater who
 say has been here far longer than our scaly tenants.  This
 say swamp creature has been ravaging our trade network down
 say at the lake, and has caused us no end of trouble.  
 say Unfortunately, we lack the equipment necessary to seek it
 say out in its watery depths to kill it, though I'm sure
 say a great explorer like yourself would be able to find it.
 say It is also said that loach skin demonstrates an immunity
 say to its attacks.  Good luck, General.
 bow $n
else
 emote coughs uneasily.
endif
~
