  mpechoaround $n The Swamp Thing wraps his head around $n's ear.
  mpechoat $n The Swamp Thing wraps his head over your ear and says:
  mpechoat $n "I like to eat kobolds.  I bet you'd like them too.
  mpechoat $n My father, the oh so mighty Prince Arcus of Atlantis
  mpechoat $n likes them too... they're quite a delicacy... take him
  mpechoat $n one and he'll be pleased."
  mpecho The Swamp Thing bursts into a fine chum of flayed flesh
  mpecho and streams of bodily fluid.
