gargolith~
The gargolith~
A large scaly beast lets forth a low rumble which shakes you to your core.~
This otherworldly creature has evidently mothered hundreds of eggs,
some of which you saw, some of which are tucked away in other
inaccessible recesses, in hopes of starting some sort of colony.  Let's hope
these things aren't too ambitious...~
