#19400
The Small River~
You find yourself on a narrow but swiftly flowing river which has been
partially blocked off upstream by some sort of landslide.  The rapids
downstream aren't navigable.  A rough path leads off to the north, where
there seems to be some sort of barking, though it's hard to make it out.~
