#19401
On the Rough Path~
You're trudging along a rough path which has been ground into dark
volcanic tuff.  The path is narrow and faint, but it seems to lead up the
steep ridge which lies to the north.  The countryside is strangely devoid
of all vegetation, and you get the feeling that something cataclysmic has
occurred here not long ago.  The path also leads off to the south.~
