#19402
On the Rim~
You find yourself gasping for air after your short, steep scramble.  You now
see that your have climbed up a high ridge above a fairly substantial 
depression of some sort which dominates the landscape to the north.  It
would be difficult to climb down into the basin from here, but you might
be able to skirt the crater to the east or north and find an easier way down.~
