#19449
On the Crater Floor~
A foul odor hanging on thick, hot air assaults your nostrils as you make 
your way across the flat bottom of the depression.  The ground here has
been fused into glass, and you find that it's quite hard to keep your footing.
There are rocks imbedded in the glass which have a metallic glint, and you
can hear the not so distant pounding of rock picks.~
